    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44547" root="&#xA;                        وزغ&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَغَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A certain reptile</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُوَببَّةٌ</span>); (S;) <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُرْصٌ</span>
[<i>a lizard of the species called gecko, of a leprous
hue,</i> as its name <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برص</span> indicates]; (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برص</span>;)
and <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَامُّ أَبْرَص</span>: (JK, M, K:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سامّ ابرص</span>
is a name of <i>the large</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَغ</span>; (A and Msb, both
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برص</span>;) or is <i>of the large</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَغ</span>. (S and K.
both in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برص</span>.)

